&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About Flipp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp partners with the largest North American retailers and brands to deliver local promotions and savings to millions of engaged shoppers daily, driving superior returns on investments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help people make smarter shopping decisions with autonomy and accountability. With rising living costs, Flipp&#39;s mission is crucial. Our Shopper Consideration Platform allows retailers and manufacturers to create digital experiences from their savings &amp;amp; deals content, aiding shoppers in deciding what to buy and where to buy it. Together, we make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Flipp joined forces with the European company &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://shopfully.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Shopfully&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, creating a global leader in the sector. Together, we reach 400 million households and serve over 1,000 top retailers and brands across 27 markets, including Europe, Canada, the USA, Latin America, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five principles, Progress Over Perfection, Clarity Through Transparency, Learn Loudly, Challenge with Empathy, and Always Build Better, bring a relentless progress mindset to life. They’re not just slogans, but they’re the behaviours we expect, reward, and hold ourselves accountable to. You&#39;ll be equipped to make an impact, realize your potential, and stay inspired every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flipp’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead&lt;/strong&gt; bridges the gap between technical solutions and sales strategies, providing dedicated support to product and sales teams to drive the expansion and adoption of Flipp’s Switch Print to Digital product and strategic ownership of Retail Digital Transformation initiatives in North America. This role will report into the &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Science&lt;/strong&gt; team at Flipp + Shopfully, which works cross-functionally with clients, analysts, and external partnerships to measure the impact of digital media and leveraging Flipp’s data to drive partner outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Retail Digital Transformation Lead at Flipp, your primary focus will be to provide dedicated support to our sales teams in driving expansion and adoption of Flipp + Shopfully’s Switch Print to Digital (SP2D) tool to our retailers across North America. We are seeking an expert in orchestrating both print media and digital media for retailers to act as a strategic advisor to the Switch Print to Digital(SP2D) product and Retail Digital Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate will guide our Go-to-Market strategy, ensuring we effectively assist retailers in reallocating print circular budgets into high-fidelity digital campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop account strategy and strengthen partnerships by influencing their long term retail technology &amp;amp; digital media objectives. You will build new opportunities, lead product demos and close deals driving while ensuring strategic objectives and revenue growth are met with each account. You will bridge the gap between product capabilities and market reality, ensuring our sales teams are equipped to handle complex objections from sophisticated retail buyers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working closely with Marketing Science as well as cross functionally including Operations, Partner Technology, Partner Insights &amp;amp; Analytics, Finance, and Media Sciences. You will be accountable to an annual quota to drive business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get the opportunity to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales and Pipeline Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead the end to end Sales cycle of our SP2D product (ie pitch, presentations, product demos) for our retail partners as the Subject Matter Expert, playing a strategic and consultative role until deals are closed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As SP2D is a technically-driven, algorithm-based, analytical tool, you will also work closely with colleagues in Marketing Science to improve and leverage the outputs from the algorithm to deliver to retailers. A typical sales cycle includes both client pitches and running the SP2D itself to develop regional execution plans to deliver back to retailers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-sales Strategic Solutioning&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work closely with customers to uncover the customer’s desired business outcomes and technical requirements and orient all activities in the sales process to these outcomes. Act as a trusted advisor to clients during the pre-sales phase, providing ongoing support and ensuring customer satisfaction until implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; GTM Management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be working closely with our Product Marketing, Product &amp;amp; Retail Technology teams to ensure seamless transition and product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate effectively with cross functional teams as required and us the voice of the customer, sharing market feedback with internal product and engineering teams, to help shape the product roadmap and strategy of retail technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurement, Data and Localization&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will develop a rigid framework for client onboarding, detailing exactly which data points are required to run the SP2D model (e.g., store lists, print quantities per location, incumbent cost structures). It will also advise on the required fidelity of distribution. Determine how to achieve deep local saturation (store-level vs. region-level) and how to ratchet up digital intensity in specific geographic pockets, and map the SP2D divest/reinvest recommendations specifically to Flipp’s product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate will be able to define how we tie post-campaign measurement back to the initial SP2D investment suggestions to prove accuracy and ROI, build robust measurement standards that meet the needs of sophisticated retail buyers, and determine the specific metrics and KPIs required to overcome skepticism from traditional print-heavy buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in orchestrating and measuring both print and digital marketing initiatives at retailers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years of leveraging technical solutions to drive sales efforts. An ideal candidate has both technical analytical skills and the ability to sell the outputs and solutions to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS/Solution Selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the North American print market and its governing dynamics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive strategy and alignment with Director+ level external contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional teams internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to meet revenue goals and build strong partnerships based on joint value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing or advising on large-scale print-to-digital budget transformations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the mechanics of print circular distribution and costs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex data strategies into simple sales narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our promise to each other:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;width: 83.5859%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 53.174%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive, collaborative environment where your voice matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote-first environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The tools and opportunities you need to grow and develop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Every opportunity to own your success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 46.8272%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your authentic self, every day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your best work, from anywhere&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appetite for learning, curiosity, and a growth mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, initiative and the mind of an entrepreneur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Here&#39;s how to apply:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is currently vacant and open for applications. If you’re interested in working with us on the future of shopping, fill out the fields below and submit your application. While experience and skill sets are valuable, growth potential and attitudes are equally important. If you’re prepared to grow dramatically with your team at a world-class learning organization, consider applying. We understand that the most creative solutions require diversity in thought and life experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flipp is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, ancestry, religion, creed, sex, national or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, family status, disability, or gender identity or expression or any other protected grounds. We are proud to be a welcoming space for employees, of every background, to bring their whole selves to work with confidence. Flipp is committed to providing appropriate accommodations to ensure our selection process is equitable, and such accommodations can be made available on request. If you require an accommodation, please contact your dedicated recruiter directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring is a deeply human process; therefore, we use AI in limited, administrative ways to help streamline our hiring process. An AI-powered scheduling tool assists with coordinating interviews, and our applicant tracking system may use AI to identify relevant keywords within applications. We do not use AI to assess your application, make hiring decisions, or conduct interviews. All evaluations are completed by real people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A member of our recruitment team will respond to you in the coming weeks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
